WEBVTT

00:05.270 --> 00:06.520
How could this be?

00:29.700 --> 00:31.200
Great Elder?!

00:52.440 --> 00:53.720
Reiren-sama!

00:53.720 --> 00:54.690
Shrine Maiden!

00:54.690 --> 00:56.440
I'm so glad you've awakened.

00:56.440 --> 00:58.730
What has happened to the Great Elder?

00:58.730 --> 00:59.540
I don't seem to see her—

00:59.540 --> 01:00.990
Everyone, calm down.

01:03.290 --> 01:06.500
I'll explain it all at once. 
Please gather everyone.

01:06.910 --> 01:09.020
The fairies and the dwarves as well.

01:09.720 --> 01:11.580
We're calling the dwarves, too?

01:11.580 --> 01:13.220
She said everyone...

01:13.220 --> 01:15.100
Even the young ones?

01:15.100 --> 01:16.590
Still...

01:16.590 --> 01:17.790
Just what is she thinking...

01:17.790 --> 01:21.840
Reiren-sama, what should we do 
with the humans we've captured?

01:22.250 --> 01:23.480
Humans?

01:24.670 --> 01:26.480
Now is not the time to—

01:28.460 --> 01:32.640
Humans... Humans, huh?

01:45.290 --> 01:49.830
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

03:04.030 --> 03:08.950
<b>Episode 6
"Elven Forest"</b>

03:11.320 --> 03:15.420
The last we heard from Dante 
was yesterday morning, wasn't it?

03:15.710 --> 03:20.250
Yes. Since then, we've lost contact 
and don't know his whereabouts.

03:20.860 --> 03:24.860
He would have been well aware of 
the dangers of the elven forest.

03:24.860 --> 03:29.060
Despite that, to think he'd make 
an arbitrary decision like this...

03:29.620 --> 03:32.520
There's a high chance that 
this was instigated by someone.

03:34.870 --> 03:37.150
I am the assistant commander, Qubirey.

03:38.680 --> 03:43.450
Anything that needs to be discussed with 
His Majesty will be done through me.

03:43.820 --> 03:46.750
Qubirey is probably an elven spy.

03:47.220 --> 03:51.050
If they hide their ears, they 
look no different from humans.

03:51.720 --> 03:52.830
If that's the case,

03:52.830 --> 03:56.780
there may be other enemies
 within the Io Rebel Army.

03:57.820 --> 04:00.820
I guess we'll have to investigate ourselves.

04:01.740 --> 04:03.880
Adept Ashran! Adept Saki!

04:05.070 --> 04:06.860
How are things behind us?

04:06.860 --> 04:08.590
N-Nothing out of the ordinary, ma'am!

04:08.590 --> 04:10.970
We'll defend the rear till our dying breath!

04:10.970 --> 04:14.490
You guys were the ones in the 
assault unit against Vanessa.

04:14.490 --> 04:15.810
I trust you.

04:15.810 --> 04:16.590
Yes, ma'am!

04:19.320 --> 04:20.460
That's...

04:26.360 --> 04:29.020
No doubt, these belong to the Io Rebel Army.

04:29.020 --> 04:31.610
Then that means Dante and the others...

04:31.610 --> 04:33.420
They fell for this trap?

04:35.770 --> 04:38.710
It doesn't seem hard to avoid, but...

04:39.240 --> 04:41.190
The real one is above us.

04:43.350 --> 04:44.170
What?

04:48.270 --> 04:49.260
How clever.

04:50.200 --> 04:51.460
If you hadn't mentioned it,

04:51.460 --> 04:53.990
I would've overlooked it in the
 sunlight through the trees.

04:55.790 --> 04:58.580
There were records of it back in my world.

04:58.580 --> 05:02.400
That elves use multiple
 magic traps all at once.

05:03.850 --> 05:04.780
Hey, Kai.

05:05.340 --> 05:06.520
I smell something.

05:06.970 --> 05:08.570
I think it's an elf.

05:11.270 --> 05:14.020
Kai, are you certain this is the right path?

05:14.020 --> 05:19.140
Yeah. Rinne has undergone special 
training to sense magic.

05:19.140 --> 05:19.960
She can handle it.

05:20.220 --> 05:21.160
I see.

05:23.980 --> 05:25.460
The smell's coming from there!

05:27.900 --> 05:29.140
What is this place?

05:29.630 --> 05:33.110
I don't know. But the smell stops here.

05:33.770 --> 05:35.440
It's a gate?!

05:45.600 --> 05:47.640
Wh-Where are we?

05:48.300 --> 05:50.130
H-Hey, Ashran?!

05:50.130 --> 05:50.960
What?

05:50.960 --> 05:53.870
D-Don't take advantage of the 
confusion to touch my butt!

05:54.290 --> 05:57.420
I-Idiot! Your butt used my hand as a landing pad!

05:57.420 --> 06:00.080
Then move your hand away quicker—

05:58.980 --> 06:00.080
Shut it.

06:00.430 --> 06:02.040
Stay quiet on enemy grounds.

06:06.910 --> 06:08.880
It seems like it's the elven forest.

06:09.440 --> 06:11.240
That thing earlier was a gate.

06:11.730 --> 06:14.180
It's a spell used by the 
celestials to teleport, and—

06:14.180 --> 06:15.100
Huh?

06:16.300 --> 06:18.730
Wait! Wait up!

06:18.730 --> 06:22.520
Become friends with me!

06:22.520 --> 06:24.180
Wait, wait, I said!

06:22.820 --> 06:24.180
Could that be...?!

06:24.180 --> 06:25.190
Please stand back.

06:25.190 --> 06:28.650
That's a celestial for sure. A great fairy.

06:37.500 --> 06:39.540
What part of the forest 
are you from, Mr. Elf?

06:39.540 --> 06:40.330
Huh?

06:40.910 --> 06:47.980
Hmm... Huh? Why don't I sense 
any magic from you?

06:47.980 --> 06:50.330
Well, we're humans.

06:50.660 --> 06:52.380
Humans?

06:52.380 --> 06:53.930
Humans...

06:55.430 --> 06:56.900
Humans?!

06:59.930 --> 07:01.950
I'm gonna get eaten!

07:01.950 --> 07:02.860
H-Hey!

07:16.610 --> 07:17.250
A human?!

07:17.250 --> 07:18.490
How did you get here?!

07:21.090 --> 07:22.090
Lower your weapons.

07:25.210 --> 07:29.590
I never would have guessed that 
you'd be able to activate the gate.

07:31.260 --> 07:34.500
I'm pleased to see you're okay, 
Assistant Commander.

07:35.310 --> 07:38.490
No, celestial spy.

07:40.520 --> 07:44.890
Qubirey will do, Knight of 
the Sacred Light, Jeanne.

07:46.530 --> 07:48.280
What's happened to Dante and the others?

07:49.370 --> 07:51.330
They're alive.

07:51.330 --> 07:54.280
They've inhaled the pollen from 
a colony of paralysis plants,

07:54.280 --> 07:57.280
so they won't be able to move a 
single finger for a few days, but...

07:57.780 --> 08:00.750
Our demand is that you release the hostages.

08:02.060 --> 08:03.460
Under one condition.

08:05.010 --> 08:05.960
Let's hear it.

08:06.770 --> 08:08.880
Please fight against the angels.

08:09.990 --> 08:12.690
For the ones who defeated 
the hero of the demons,

08:12.690 --> 08:13.990
it should be an easy task.

08:14.930 --> 08:16.510
What's this all about?

08:16.510 --> 08:19.300
I thought the celestials were 
a close-knit race.

08:19.730 --> 08:21.890
Are the elves going to betray the angels?

08:23.060 --> 08:25.900
The angels betrayed us first.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.270
Come this way.

08:30.270 --> 08:32.190
Reiren-sama awaits.

08:39.560 --> 08:43.130
This is the first time that humans 
have entered the elf village.

08:44.500 --> 08:47.050
You won't be welcomed, but you 
should take pride in doing so.

08:49.640 --> 08:52.970
I'm the village shrine maiden, Reiren.

08:53.470 --> 08:56.110
I'm the commander of the 
Urza Rebel Army, Jeanne.

08:58.390 --> 09:02.270
Are you really the ones who 
defeated the hero of the demons?

09:02.270 --> 09:03.070
That's right.

09:04.970 --> 09:06.400
The one called Jeanne.

09:06.890 --> 09:11.530
The item you don under your armor... 
That's an elven garment, isn't it?

09:11.530 --> 09:12.990
Where did you acquire it?

09:13.730 --> 09:15.930
Along the borders of the Urza Federation.

09:15.930 --> 09:18.680
It was a magic item that the 
demons stole from the celestials.

09:18.680 --> 09:21.260
We ambushed them and acquired it.

09:21.800 --> 09:23.950
This was more than ten years ago.

09:24.810 --> 09:26.890
If it wasn't directly stolen from an elf,

09:26.890 --> 09:29.420
then we'll let it slide this time.

09:30.170 --> 09:32.420
I propose a contract with you.

09:33.080 --> 09:34.380
A contract?

09:35.130 --> 09:37.360
We'll return the hostages.

09:38.260 --> 09:44.600
In return, we'd like you to rescue 
our Great Elder from Lord Alfreya.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.840
Alfreya...

09:48.630 --> 09:53.070
The hero of the celestials is the 
one who captured your Great Elder?

09:55.670 --> 09:58.410
Lord Alfreya has changed.

10:00.370 --> 10:03.280
For one who was as warm and gentle as he

10:04.180 --> 10:10.570
to suddenly demand that elves, dwarves, 
and fairies be subservient to angels...

10:11.660 --> 10:13.960
Of course, it wasn't 
something we could accept.

10:16.110 --> 10:20.620
The Great Elder and I went to speak to 
him on behalf of the other races.

10:21.870 --> 10:26.980
But he would hear none of it 
and captured the Great Elder.

10:27.810 --> 10:30.580
I barely managed to escape, but...

10:32.340 --> 10:36.420
He will no longer hear our words.

10:38.580 --> 10:39.830
I'll give you some guidance.

10:40.450 --> 10:44.580
But consider this something you 
humans will do on your own.

10:45.500 --> 10:50.750
An elf cannot directly run to the rescue 
and fight with the angels, is that it?

10:51.020 --> 10:51.710
Indeed.

10:52.060 --> 10:55.170
Where's the proof that 
this is not a trap?

10:55.490 --> 10:59.690
If we were to go through with this and get 
ambushed by both the elves and angels,

10:59.690 --> 11:01.310
we'd be annihilated.

11:02.620 --> 11:04.600
I'll give you my life.

11:05.610 --> 11:06.720
Qubirey...

11:07.160 --> 11:10.340
I'll accompany you to the angel palace.

11:10.950 --> 11:14.660
If, at any time, you feel that 
Reiren-sama isn't telling the truth,

11:14.660 --> 11:17.790
feel free to capture, kill, 
or do whatever you wish with me.

11:17.790 --> 11:18.530
Unacceptable.

11:20.190 --> 11:24.080
Don't think that your single 
life is worth the six of ours

11:24.080 --> 11:26.950
plus the twenty lives of the hostages.

11:26.950 --> 11:28.760
Increase the number of lives on your end.

11:28.760 --> 11:31.770
Or choose a more valuable 
life to put on the line.

11:34.730 --> 11:36.920
My life should be enough.

11:38.090 --> 11:39.250
No, you mustn't!

11:39.250 --> 11:42.550
With the Great Elder absent, we can't 
have you, the shrine maiden—

11:44.710 --> 11:46.600
I'll accompany you.

11:47.130 --> 11:51.100
If you have any doubts, 
then take my life on the spot.

11:53.570 --> 11:54.880
Very well.

11:54.880 --> 11:55.860
Reiren-sama!

11:56.350 --> 11:57.040
It's all right.

11:57.540 --> 12:01.800
It wasn't the fairies nor the dwarves 
who had their Great Elder captured.

12:01.800 --> 12:02.670
It was the elves.

12:03.500 --> 12:07.490
If we don't do anything, we're tacitly 
accepting the angels as our masters.

12:07.490 --> 12:08.370
Still...

12:08.990 --> 12:10.880
This is my decision.

12:11.390 --> 12:15.660
Even if the humans were to fail 
and anger Lord Alfreya further,

12:15.660 --> 12:17.710
my one life will settle things smoothly.

12:18.540 --> 12:21.130
We must avoid a civil war among 
the celestials at all costs.

12:21.660 --> 12:24.060
The rest of you must not take action yet.

12:24.060 --> 12:29.180
Fairies, dwarves, return to your posts!

12:36.070 --> 12:36.650
Silk.

12:38.090 --> 12:39.110
Okay!

12:45.710 --> 12:46.840
This is...

12:46.840 --> 12:48.760
Fairy magic, huh?

12:48.760 --> 12:50.300
Hurry up and sit down.

12:51.230 --> 12:53.690
I'll explain the details.

12:56.420 --> 12:57.920
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

12:59.420 --> 13:00.920
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

13:13.670 --> 13:15.310
I fail to understand...

13:17.010 --> 13:19.940
why humans choose to stay awake when 
they need to light a fire to do so.

13:22.030 --> 13:23.900
I won't attack you while you sleep.

13:24.680 --> 13:27.270
We won't make any moves 
until our contract is up.

13:28.690 --> 13:29.670
All right.

13:31.250 --> 13:33.200
I heard from that Jeanne fellow

13:33.740 --> 13:37.660
that you and that girl over there 
were the ones who defeated Vanessa.

13:39.030 --> 13:40.810
So I have a question for you.

13:41.700 --> 13:44.860
How did I manage to defeat her?

13:44.860 --> 13:46.660
I won't ask that much.

13:47.400 --> 13:49.050
But your power...

13:50.900 --> 13:53.010
will it work on the Lord of Heaven, Alfreya?

13:55.790 --> 13:59.020
It almost sounds as though 
you're asking me to defeat him.

14:01.160 --> 14:03.610
When we head for the 
angel palace tomorrow,

14:03.610 --> 14:06.600
you'll surely end up fighting him.

14:07.970 --> 14:10.700
The power that defeated Vanessa...

14:11.500 --> 14:13.920
if it's not enough, 
we'll just end up dying together.

14:14.460 --> 14:17.120
Yeah, I suppose so.

14:18.790 --> 14:20.790
Keep this in mind.

14:20.790 --> 14:22.090
If you run out of fear,

14:23.240 --> 14:25.460
I won't let you leave this forest alive.

14:26.840 --> 14:28.090
I know.

14:30.110 --> 14:32.440
Can I ask something as well?

14:32.440 --> 14:33.310
What is it?

14:34.610 --> 14:36.980
Do you know a human named Sid?

14:37.850 --> 14:38.830
Sid?

14:39.780 --> 14:41.150
Who is that?

14:41.970 --> 14:45.150
Nothing. If you don't know, that's fine.

14:49.850 --> 14:52.160
<i>Even the elf shrine maiden 
doesn't know of him...</i>

14:53.680 --> 14:56.280
<i>The one most likely to know...</i>

14:57.810 --> 15:00.010
The world will be recreated...

15:00.670 --> 15:04.210
Sid called this phenomenon 
"World Reincarnation."

15:04.910 --> 15:10.220
Someone caused the world reincarnation 
to occur, altering the world...

15:10.580 --> 15:12.720
Find that being!

15:13.040 --> 15:17.940
It must be one of the other three heroes.

15:19.970 --> 15:24.880
<i>The hero of the celestials... 
the Lord of Heaven, Alfreya.</i>

15:27.880 --> 15:32.950
This is Search Unit A. 
We'll be entering the angel palace.

15:34.330 --> 15:38.830
I really hope our messages are 
reaching headquarters safely.

15:38.830 --> 15:40.570
It is pretty far from here.

15:42.220 --> 15:45.280
The angel palace is above this tree, right?

15:45.710 --> 15:46.780
That's right.

15:47.330 --> 15:49.210
Even though you guys can't see it.

15:49.970 --> 15:52.820
There are a few floating fortresses,

15:52.820 --> 15:56.030
but the one considered the angel 
palace is the one above here.

15:57.210 --> 15:59.480
Lord Alfreya is there, after all.

16:02.010 --> 16:03.660
A double-layer rig, huh?

16:04.260 --> 16:08.130
This is quite elaborate. Is it 
a countermeasure against humans?

16:08.130 --> 16:10.110
Who would be afraid of humans?

16:10.830 --> 16:17.280
The ones we're on alert for are 
demons, spirits, and mythical beasts.

16:17.740 --> 16:19.460
The demons felt the same way.

16:19.960 --> 16:24.750
Then the angels probably have the majority 
of their army stationed at the border,

16:24.750 --> 16:27.430
and only a handful to protect 
the angel palace as well.

16:27.930 --> 16:29.050
I see.

16:29.050 --> 16:32.750
It seems you didn't defeat the 
demons out of luck after all.

16:36.030 --> 16:42.220
<i>I know a man who faced all 
four heroes by himself.</i>

16:59.910 --> 17:03.520
So this is... the angel palace.

17:05.530 --> 17:07.710
What is that smell?

17:12.770 --> 17:13.960
This is...

17:18.980 --> 17:20.850
They aren't dead.

17:20.850 --> 17:22.310
Still, who could have done this?

17:22.910 --> 17:25.970
We don't know, but right 
now it works in our favor.

17:25.970 --> 17:27.170
Let's move on.

17:27.170 --> 17:29.480
I know. Follow me.

17:35.750 --> 17:37.540
What a stroke of luck.

17:37.540 --> 17:39.570
If we didn't have the elf's guidance,

17:39.570 --> 17:42.520
entering the palace would 
have proved very difficult.

17:42.520 --> 17:45.480
In a way, I suppose we have 
Dante to thank for this.

17:45.480 --> 17:46.660
Don't get ahead of yourselves.

17:47.300 --> 17:51.920
Don't forget, we still hold 
that human's life in our hands.

18:03.900 --> 18:06.890
Oh? Oh dear, dear, dear.

18:07.220 --> 18:09.100
What a nasty stench...

18:09.850 --> 18:12.980
Just as I thought. It was you, Reiren.

18:14.710 --> 18:18.880
What did you just say, War Angel Vicious?

18:21.130 --> 18:23.480
Have your ears failed you, as well?

18:23.480 --> 18:27.180
But then, you were always a mere 
beast that crawls on the ground.

18:27.180 --> 18:28.650
To think you would turn on us as well...

18:29.360 --> 18:32.030
I am servant to the Lord of Heaven, Alfreya-sama.

18:32.610 --> 18:35.360
I act according to His will.

18:36.380 --> 18:39.790
Were you the one who attacked 
the angels outside?

18:40.730 --> 18:44.740
They were disloyal fools 
who refused to obey Alfreya-sama.

18:45.160 --> 18:47.600
The Lord of Heaven himself 
handed down their punishment.

18:48.250 --> 18:49.350
I see...

18:50.380 --> 18:53.940
Soon, the execution of the Great 
Elder of the elves will take place.

18:53.940 --> 18:58.380
It'll serve as a message to the
 elves, fairies, and dwarves:

18:58.380 --> 19:03.280
You are inferior to the angels. Bow down!

19:10.420 --> 19:11.220
Fire!

19:12.900 --> 19:15.630
I can't believe you would bring 
humans to the angel palace!

19:16.050 --> 19:19.680
Jeanne-sama, leave this 
to us and go on ahead.

19:19.680 --> 19:21.050
Go, Kai!

19:23.250 --> 19:24.300
I won't allow it!

19:28.610 --> 19:31.370
To think that the humans would 
fight against the angels...

19:32.520 --> 19:35.400
Yeah, we hear that a lot.

19:41.990 --> 19:43.160
Look out!

19:51.450 --> 19:55.630
To oppose our Lord is a foolish thing.

19:56.770 --> 19:59.260
I thought it'd be you, Raphaelo.

20:00.550 --> 20:02.130
Kai, go on ahead!

20:02.590 --> 20:03.590
Rinne...

20:05.880 --> 20:07.010
Make sure you catch up to us!

20:07.010 --> 20:09.130
Yup, I will!

20:09.450 --> 20:10.430
Let's hurry.

20:13.100 --> 20:17.150
I see. You choose to sacrifice 
yourself for the others.

20:17.640 --> 20:20.440
What are you talking about? I just thought...

20:22.230 --> 20:24.120
I want to give it my all!

20:33.330 --> 20:34.920
Wait just a moment.

20:44.260 --> 20:48.840
Seems he's being protected 
by dozens of barriers.

20:49.580 --> 20:52.560
He's the hero of the celestials, after all.

20:53.570 --> 20:55.280
Kai, one thing.

20:57.690 --> 21:02.690
I'm sorry for leaving the most dangerous
 battle, the one with Vanessa, to you.

21:03.300 --> 21:04.840
I've wanted to say that for some time.

21:05.890 --> 21:07.030
Jeanne...

21:09.010 --> 21:12.170
I'll be fighting alongside you this time.

21:18.170 --> 21:19.120
We're going.

21:33.180 --> 21:34.180
Great Elder!

21:36.890 --> 21:39.430
The heavens are filled with rage.

21:40.850 --> 21:46.690
Those without wings, the earth dwellers, 
those who look up at the heavens...

21:48.620 --> 21:50.200
Why do you disobey?

21:51.360 --> 21:53.120
Lord Alfreya...

21:53.630 --> 21:58.590
All blessings come from the Heavens 
and are bestowed upon the earth.

21:58.590 --> 22:00.170
This is divine providence.

22:01.470 --> 22:02.920
But...

22:04.700 --> 22:07.760
Only the angels are entitled to 
receive such blessings.

23:34.220 --> 23:41.050
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?
